Description: simple Qt6-based system tray application
 Qt-App demonstrates how to build a modern cross-platform GUI
 with Qt6 and CMake. Features include:
 .
  - System tray icon and context menu
  - Native OS theme integration
  - Clean C++17/20 code base
 .
 This package ships the main executable.